{"slug":"kh-ss-m","ar":"خ ص م","total":18,"core":"dispute","forms":[{"ar":"ٱخْتَصَمُ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":8,"gloss":"to dispute","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":96,"p":4,"ar":["قَالُوا۟","وَهُمْ","فِيهَا","يَخْتَصِمُونَ"],"en":"They will say while they dispute therein"}},{"ar":"خَصِيم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"opponent, adversary","word":null,"ex":{"s":16,"a":4,"p":7,"ar":["خَلَقَ","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","مِن","نُّطْفَةٍ","فَإِذَا","هُوَ","خَصِيمٌ","مُّبِينٌ"],"en":"He created man from a sperm-drop; then at once, he is a clear adversary"}},{"ar":"خَصْم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"litigant, adversary","word":null,"ex":{"s":38,"a":21,"p":4,"ar":["وَهَلْ","أَتَىٰكَ","نَبَؤُا۟","ٱلْخَصْمِ","إِذْ","تَسَوَّرُوا۟","ٱلْمِحْرَابَ"],"en":"And has there come to you the news of the adversaries, when they climbed over the wall of [his] prayer chamber"}},{"ar":"تَخَاصُم","kind":"verbal noun","form":6,"count":1,"gloss":"mutual quarreling","word":null,"ex":{"s":38,"a":64,"p":4,"ar":["إِنَّ","ذَٰلِكَ","لَحَقٌّ","تَخَاصُمُ","أَهْلِ","ٱلنَّارِ"],"en":"Indeed, that is truth - the quarreling of the people of the Fire"}},{"ar":"خَصِمُون","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"contentious","word":null,"ex":{"s":43,"a":58,"p":14,"ar":["وَقَالُوٓا۟","ءَأَـٰلِهَتُنَا","خَيْرٌ","أَمْ","هُوَ ۚ","مَا","ضَرَبُوهُ","لَكَ","إِلَّا","جَدَلًۢا ۚ","بَلْ","هُمْ","قَوْمٌ","خَصِمُونَ"],"en":"And they said, \"Are your gods better, or is he?\" They did not present the comparison except for [mere] argument. But, [in fact], they are a people prone to dispute"}}],"surahs":[[38,4],[22,2],[36,2],[43,2],[2,1],[3,1],[4,1],[16,1],[26,1],[27,1],[39,1],[50,1]]}